Package: pakidsrpipeline
Title: PAK IDSR Bulletin Extraction Pipeline
Version: 1.0.0
Description: Downloads and parses Pakistan NIH IDSR weekly bulletin PDFs
    into the disease-counts and compliance CSVs used by the surveillance
    dashboard. Not an installable package in its own right -- this
    DESCRIPTION file exists purely so GitHub Actions' r-lib/actions/setup-r-dependencies
    step can resolve both the R packages and the underlying system
    libraries (e.g. libgdal, libgeos, poppler-utils) that sf and pdftools
    need to install cleanly on a bare runner.
Imports:
    xml2,
    rvest,
    stringr,
    dplyr,
    purrr,
    pdftools,
    stringdist,
    tidyr,
    readr,
    fs
Encoding: UTF-8
